{"strings": [
  {"text":"Moominpappa at Sea","translation":"姆米爸爸航海記","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json title"},
  {"text":"The end of August: everything in the valley is done, and Moominpappa takes his family to a bare island with a dark lighthouse. Each of them looks for a place of their own there — and each finds a loneliness. Whom does Papa notice, and whom does he miss?","translation":"八月底：姆米谷裡的事都做完了，姆米爸爸帶著全家來到一座光禿禿的小島，島上有一座熄了燈的燈塔。每個人都在那裡尋找屬於自己的地方——而每個人都找到了一份孤獨。爸爸會注意到誰，又會錯過誰？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json description"},
  {"text":"A bare island, a dark lighthouse, one lantern for the whole family — and whom will Papa give it to?","translation":"一座光禿禿的小島，一座熄了燈的燈塔，全家只有一盞提燈——爸爸會把它交給誰？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json line"},
  {"text":"after the novel by Tove Jansson","translation":"改編自朵貝．楊笙的小說","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json source"},
  {"text":"The Crossing","translation":"渡海","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The lantern in the boat","translation":"船上的提燈","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Put it out","translation":"熄掉","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Leave it burning","translation":"讓它亮著","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Give it to the son","translation":"交給兒子","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman","translation":"漁夫","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We are the new keepers”","translation":"「我們是新來的燈塔看守人」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Ask him to breakfast","translation":"請他來吃早餐","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Sit beside him in silence","translation":"默默坐在他身邊","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We steer by that star. The captain knows the way","who":"papa","translation":"我們朝那顆星星開。船長認得路","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The moon’s path. Pretty","who":"papa","translation":"月光的小路。真美","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Put out the lantern. We’ll go by the stars.”","translation":"「把提燈熄掉。我們看星星走。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Leave it burning. Mama will wake up and be frightened.”","translation":"「讓它亮著。媽媽醒來會害怕的。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Here. Shine it back, since you’re looking.”","translation":"「拿去。既然你在看，就往後面照一照。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Put out the lantern. We’ll go by the stars","who":"papa","translation":"把提燈熄掉。我們看星星走","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Where are we?","who":"mama","translation":"我們在哪裡？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Where we ought to be","who":"papa","translation":"在該在的地方","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Leave it burning. Mama will wake up and be frightened","who":"papa","translation":"讓它亮著。媽媽醒來會害怕的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Here. Shine it back, since you’re looking","who":"papa","translation":"拿去。既然你在看，就往後面照一照","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"So… a bit to the left… I think","who":"papa","translation":"這樣……再左邊一點……我想是吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"23 August","translation":"8月23日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"A keeper always leaves the key. That’s how it’s done","who":"papa","translation":"燈塔看守人總會留下鑰匙。規矩就是這樣","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"There’s an arrow here. For fools","who":"my","translation":"這裡有個箭頭。給笨蛋看的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Somebody has been here","who":"mama","translation":"有人來過這裡","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Gulls","who":"papa","translation":"海鷗","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Enough for three lanterns","who":"mama","translation":"夠點三盞提燈","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"When the wind drops I’ll sail for more. This is going to be our home","who":"papa","translation":"等風停了，我再開船去多拿一些。這裡將會是我們的家","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Wind south-west. Nobody again","who":"my","translation":"西南風。又是沒有人","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve covered him up","who":"my","translation":"你把他蓋起來了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"He doesn’t need it any more","who":"papa","translation":"他已經不需要了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We are the new keepers. If anything happens — you know where to find us.”","translation":"「我們是新來的燈塔看守人。要是有什麼事——你知道去哪裡找我們。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We have breakfast by the lighthouse. Do come.”","translation":"「我們在燈塔旁邊吃早餐。請一定要來。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Sit down beside him without a word","translation":"一句話也不說，在他身邊坐下","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We are the new keepers. If anything happens — you know where to find us","who":"papa","translation":"我們是新來的燈塔看守人。要是有什麼事——你知道去哪裡找我們","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We have breakfast by the lighthouse. Do come","who":"papa","translation":"我們在燈塔旁邊吃早餐。請一定要來","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"No need","who":"fisher","translation":"不用了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Mamma bakes pancakes…","who":"papa","translation":"媽媽會烤鬆餅……","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The sea is good today","who":"fisher","translation":"今天的海很好","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Good","who":"papa","translation":"很好","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"All done","who":"mama","translation":"都好了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The Lighthouse Is Dark","translation":"燈塔不亮","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Papa’s day","translation":"爸爸的一天","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Measure the pool","translation":"測量水潭","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Carry seaweed for Mama","translation":"幫媽媽搬海草","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Go to the Fisherman","translation":"去找漁夫","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Whose lantern tonight","translation":"今晚提燈給誰","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Up to the lamp","translation":"上去守著燈","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama, with a term","translation":"給媽媽，訂個期限","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The son, no questions","translation":"給兒子，什麼也不問","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"By turns","translation":"輪流","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"He doesn’t want to","who":"papa","translation":"他不想亮","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"It’s you who can’t","who":"my","translation":"是你不會","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse takes time!","who":"papa","translation":"燈塔這種事急不得！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mine","who":"troll","translation":"我的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"How beautiful you are…","who":"troll","translation":"你們好美啊……","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Measure the black pool","translation":"測量黑水潭","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Go to the Fisherman and ask about the lighthouse","translation":"去找漁夫，問問燈塔的事","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Nothing will grow here","who":"mama","translation":"這裡什麼也長不出來","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"It will for me","who":"papa","translation":"在我手裡就長得出來","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Why isn’t he lit?","who":"papa","translation":"它為什麼不亮？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"He shines outward","who":"fisher","translation":"它是往外面照的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll understand you. You’ll see","who":"papa","translation":"我會弄懂你的。等著瞧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The bread was taken","who":"mama","translation":"麵包被拿走了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse is lit at dusk","who":"papa","translation":"燈塔要在黃昏時點亮","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"So light it, then","who":"my","translation":"那你就點啊","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it, take it. I can see well enough","who":"mama","translation":"拿去，拿去。我看得夠清楚了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it, take it","who":"mama","translation":"拿去，拿去","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Can I have the lantern? For the whole night","who":"troll","translation":"提燈可以給我嗎？整個晚上","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"What for?","who":"papa","translation":"要做什麼？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I need it","who":"troll","translation":"我需要","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Night 1, 23/24 August","translation":"第一夜，8月23日至24日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Up to the lamp: “Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp.”","translation":"上去守著燈：「在我把它點亮之前，我就睡在燈旁邊。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To Mama: “The captain sets a term. Not lit by the full moon — we turn for home.”","translation":"給媽媽：「船長訂個期限。月圓之前還不亮——我們就掉頭回家。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To the son: “Take it. I won’t ask.”","translation":"給兒子：「拿去吧。我不會問。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"By turns: “Mama till bedtime, then me, toward morning — you.”","translation":"輪流：「媽媽用到睡覺，然後換我，天快亮時——給你。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp","who":"papa","translation":"在我把它點亮之前，我就睡在燈旁邊","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"“In wind, warm the burner with paraffin till the flame turns blue. Do not let go before.”","who":"papa","translation":"「起風時，要用煤油把燈頭燒熱，直到火焰變藍。在那之前不可放手。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The captain sets a term. If it isn’t lit by the full moon — we turn for home","who":"papa","translation":"船長訂個期限。要是月圓之前還不亮——我們就掉頭回家","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Three nights till the full moon","who":"mama","translation":"離月圓還有三個晚上","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Three","who":"papa","translation":"三個","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Home? Where everything’s done?","who":"my","translation":"回家？回那個什麼都做完了的地方？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Somebody is crying","who":"mama","translation":"有人在哭","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Let it burn low","who":"mama","translation":"把火調小一點","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it. I won’t ask","who":"papa","translation":"拿去吧。我不會問","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"There. That’s for you","who":"troll","translation":"喏。這是給你的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama till bedtime, then me, and toward morning — you","who":"papa","translation":"媽媽用到睡覺，然後換我，天快亮時——給你","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"All right","who":"mama","translation":"好吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama’s Garden","translation":"媽媽的花園","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Mama in the wall","translation":"牆裡的媽媽","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“She’s out walking” — and up","translation":"「她出去散步了」——然後上樓","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Call her","translation":"呼喚她","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"A cup, and wait","translation":"一杯茶，然後等待","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Night 2: the hand on the lantern","translation":"第二夜：提燈上的手","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Don’t open your eyes","translation":"別睜開眼睛","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“Put it back”","translation":"「放回去」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Go after him","translation":"跟上去","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"24 August","translation":"8月24日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Trees don’t walk","who":"papa","translation":"樹是不會走路的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"They’re afraid","who":"my","translation":"它們在害怕","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Toughening up. Quite right","who":"papa","translation":"在鍛鍊自己。很好","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Ti-iny, isn’t it","who":"my","translation":"好——小喔，對吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"And no Papa","who":"my","translation":"而且爸爸不在","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"He’s at the lighthouse","who":"mama","translation":"他在燈塔上","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"That’s new. Wasn’t there this morning","who":"my","translation":"這是新的。早上還沒有","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Fine","who":"my","translation":"還好","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“She’s out walking. The island is small” — and up to the lamp","translation":"「她出去散步了。島很小。」——然後上去守著燈","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Call: “Mamma! Mamma!” — his palm on the wall","translation":"呼喚：「媽媽！媽媽！」——手掌貼在牆上","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Put a cup of tea by the wall and sit down to wait. Not to move, whoever comes","translation":"在牆邊放一杯茶，坐下來等。不管誰來，都不離開","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"She’s out walking. The island is small","who":"papa","translation":"她出去散步了。島很小","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Mamma! Mamma!","who":"papa","translation":"媽媽！媽媽！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I only lay down for a moment under the apple tree","who":"mama","translation":"我只是在蘋果樹下躺了一下","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Two more nights","who":"mama","translation":"還有兩個晚上","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Pappa, I…","who":"troll","translation":"爸爸，我……","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Shh. Later","who":"papa","translation":"噓。等一下再說","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"And I found a line here, by the way. The old keeper’s. By myself, under the dust","who":"papa","translation":"對了，我在這裡找到一行字。是以前那個看守人寫的。我自己找到的，在灰塵底下","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"How good that you noticed","who":"mama","translation":"你注意到了，真好","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Night 2, 24/25 August","translation":"第二夜，8月24日至25日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Up top the camp bed is empty: “I sleep by the lamp” is broken.","translation":"上面的行軍床是空的：「我睡在燈旁邊」沒有做到。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Let it burn low. Somebody’s howling","who":"mama","translation":"把火調小一點。有什麼在嚎叫","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“Where are you going? Put it back. I need it.”","translation":"「你要去哪裡？放回去。我需要它。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll knows that his father knows.","translation":"姆米托魯知道爸爸知道。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going? Put it back. I need it","who":"papa","translation":"你要去哪裡？放回去。我需要它","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“The oil is thick: warm it in a pan on the stove, carry it wrapped. On a quiet evening the warm oil runs by itself; in wind — only with paraffin.”","who":"papa","translation":"「燈油很濃稠：放在爐子上的鍋裡加熱，包好了再拿上去。風平浪靜的傍晚，熱油會自己流；起風時——就只能靠煤油。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“I won’t ask” is broken.","translation":"「我不會問」沒有做到。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Up top the camp bed stays empty till morning: “I sleep by the lamp” is broken.","translation":"上面的行軍床一直空到早上：「我睡在燈旁邊」沒有做到。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"You promised not to ask","who":"my","translation":"你答應過不問的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I didn’t ask","who":"papa","translation":"我沒有問","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Spy","who":"my","translation":"間諜","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The Storm","translation":"暴風雨","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where Papa is in the storm","translation":"暴風雨裡爸爸在哪裡","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the lighthouse","translation":"點亮燈塔","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Hold the door with everyone","translation":"和大家一起頂住門","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"To the Fisherman on the cape","translation":"去岬角找漁夫","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The burner — and run down","translation":"點上燈頭——然後跑下樓","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Night 3: the paw on his shoulder","translation":"第三夜：肩上的爪子","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Let him go”","translation":"「讓他去吧」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Mama is right”","translation":"「媽媽說得對」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“As far as the dune”","translation":"「陪你到沙丘那裡」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"25 August","translation":"8月25日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There’s going to be a storm","who":"papa","translation":"暴風雨要來了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"With one paw, you might say. Against the wind","who":"papa","translation":"可以說是一隻爪子就搞定了。還是逆風喔","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"He pulled too","who":"my","translation":"他也有拉","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son takes the lantern to the Groke. Every night","who":"my","translation":"你兒子把提燈拿去給莫蘭。每天晚上","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke. The one you left him","who":"my","translation":"你兒子把提燈拿去給莫蘭了。就是你留給他的那盞","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke last night. And you watched and lay there","who":"my","translation":"你兒子昨天晚上把提燈拿去給莫蘭了。你明明看見了，還躺著不動","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke last night. And you snored. Pretending","who":"my","translation":"你兒子昨天晚上把提燈拿去給莫蘭了。你還在打呼。裝的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son goes to the Groke at night. Without a lantern. He sits there and freezes","who":"my","translation":"你兒子晚上都去找莫蘭。沒帶提燈。就坐在那裡挨凍","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama was in the wall all day yesterday. She came out when you weren’t there","who":"my","translation":"媽媽昨天一整天都待在牆裡。你不在的時候她才出來","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"My","who":"mama","translation":"小不點","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama knows where the boy goes at night.","translation":"媽媽知道兒子晚上去哪裡。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Bread again","who":"my","translation":"又是麵包","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The stove’s flooded","who":"mama","translation":"爐子被水淹了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Full moon","who":"mama","translation":"月圓了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the lighthouse with the last of the paraffin","translation":"用最後一點煤油點亮燈塔","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Hold the door with everyone: “When it drops, we sail home.”","translation":"和大家一起頂住門：「等風停了，我們就開船回家。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Go out to the cape, to the Fisherman","translation":"到岬角上去找漁夫","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the burner — and run down to the door","translation":"點上燈頭——然後跑下樓到門口","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Man overboard. The captain is going","who":"papa","translation":"有人落水。船長來了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Have you gone mad?","who":"my","translation":"你瘋了嗎？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going, in such water?","who":"mama","translation":"浪這麼大，你要去哪裡？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Well, there","who":"mama","translation":"好啦","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Be careful out there","who":"mama","translation":"在外面要小心","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You won’t take it! Do you hear? You won’t take it!","who":"papa","translation":"你帶不走它！聽到沒有？你帶不走它！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The oil is warm. Till it turns blue","who":"papa","translation":"油是熱的。燒到變藍為止","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Till it turns blue","who":"papa","translation":"燒到變藍為止","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Well. Come on","who":"papa","translation":"好。來吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"When it drops, we sail home","who":"papa","translation":"等風停了，我們就開船回家","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The captain remembers","who":"papa","translation":"船長記得","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve told that one","who":"my","translation":"這個你講過了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I want to go home","who":"mama","translation":"我想回家","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Pass me the blanket","who":"mama","translation":"把毯子遞給我","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You won’t get me!","who":"papa","translation":"休想抓到我！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"On a night like this he ought to burn","who":"fisher","translation":"這樣的夜裡，它應該要亮","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman spoke to Papa.","translation":"漁夫對爸爸開口說話了。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"26 August","translation":"8月26日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There, you see","who":"papa","translation":"你看吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There, there. It’s all right","who":"papa","translation":"好了，好了。沒事了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Night 3, 26/27 August","translation":"第三夜，8月26日至27日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Later","who":"troll","translation":"等一下再說","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Without a lantern? She’ll freeze you","who":"mama","translation":"沒帶提燈？她會把你凍僵的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Let her","who":"troll","translation":"凍就凍吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going? To freeze again?","who":"mama","translation":"你要去哪裡？又要去挨凍嗎？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I need to","who":"troll","translation":"我得去","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Tell him","who":"mama","translation":"你跟他說","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Let him go.”","translation":"「讓他去吧。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Mama is right.”","translation":"「媽媽說得對。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Come on. I’ll go with you as far as the dune.”","translation":"「走吧。我陪你到沙丘那裡。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Let him go","who":"papa","translation":"讓他去吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"She isn’t frightening. She’s just cold","who":"troll","translation":"她不可怕。她只是很冷","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama is right","who":"papa","translation":"媽媽說得對","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Come on. I’ll go with you as far as the dune","who":"papa","translation":"走吧。我陪你到沙丘那裡","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll go on by myself from here","who":"troll","translation":"接下來我自己走","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Epilogue","translation":"尾聲","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"27 August","translation":"8月27日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The Beam","translation":"光束","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A week later","translation":"一個星期後","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I can now","who":"papa","translation":"我現在會了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“I am forty today. Nobody knows.” Ha. I know","who":"my","translation":"「今天我四十歲了。沒有人知道。」哈。我知道","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The lighthouse shone far. For everyone who was at sea","who":"narrator","translation":"燈塔的光照得很遠。照給每一個在海上的人","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Boat to the Valley","translation":"回山谷的小船","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The captain keeps his word","who":"papa","translation":"船長說話算話","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The captain didn’t light it","who":"my","translation":"船長沒有點亮它","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"That’s not how it was","who":"my","translation":"才不是那樣","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Pie on the Cape","translation":"岬角上的派","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A wave — higher than the lighthouse. And we sit there. Like two rocks","who":"papa","translation":"一個浪——比燈塔還高。我們就坐在那裡。像兩塊岩石","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Yesterday it wasn’t like that","who":"papa","translation":"昨天不是這樣的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Today is his birthday","who":"papa","translation":"今天是他的生日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"At last","who":"my","translation":"總算","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll go and wash the tin","who":"mama","translation":"我去洗烤模","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Go on, go on","who":"papa","translation":"去吧，去吧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“27 August. Quiet.”","who":"papa","translation":"「8月27日。平靜。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“I am forty today. Nobody knows.” Forty! Old!","who":"my","translation":"「今天我四十歲了。沒有人知道。」四十歲！好老！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"You shouldn’t have","who":"fisher","translation":"你不必這樣的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Tomorrow will be quiet too","who":"fisher","translation":"明天也會很平靜","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Halfway up the Stair","translation":"樓梯半途","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Up top and down below. The captain is in time everywhere","who":"papa","translation":"上面和下面。船長哪裡都趕得上","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"You were everywhere","who":"mama","translation":"你哪裡都在","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Papa sat on the stair. The sea was silent","who":"narrator","translation":"爸爸坐在樓梯上。大海沉默著","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Quiet August","translation":"平靜的八月","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"How to tell them","translation":"怎麼告訴他們","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To everyone at supper","translation":"晚餐時告訴大家","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To Mama, in the evening","translation":"晚上告訴媽媽","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"20 August","translation":"8月20日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"At the end of August everything in the valley was already done. Papa walked about the garden looking for something to do","who":"narrator","translation":"八月底，姆米谷裡的事都已經做完了。爸爸在花園裡走來走去，想找點事情做","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Fire! I’ve put out a fire!","who":"papa","translation":"失火了！我把火撲滅了！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"I put out a fire","who":"papa","translation":"我把火撲滅了","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse. And not lit","who":"papa","translation":"一座燈塔。而且沒有亮","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"But somebody must have lived there","who":"papa","translation":"可是一定有人在那裡住過","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"At supper, to everyone at once: “We’re moving to the lighthouse!”","translation":"晚餐時，對大家一起說：「我們要搬到燈塔去！」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Tell Mama in the evening, when the children are asleep","translation":"晚上等孩子們睡了，再告訴媽媽","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"We’re moving to the lighthouse!","who":"papa","translation":"我們要搬到燈塔去！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Hooray!","who":"my","translation":"萬歲！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To the lighthouse? For good?","who":"troll","translation":"去燈塔？永遠住在那裡？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll pack our things","who":"mama","translation":"我來收拾東西","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Is there any earth there?","who":"mama","translation":"那裡有泥土嗎？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"There’s a lighthouse there!","who":"papa","translation":"那裡有燈塔！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"All right. I’ll take my paints","who":"mama","translation":"好吧。我帶上我的顏料","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve already decided everything. Boring","who":"my","translation":"你們什麼都決定好了。真無聊","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Leave the candles. There’s a lighthouse!","who":"papa","translation":"蠟燭留下。那裡有燈塔！","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"And your paints?","who":"my","translation":"那你的顏料呢？","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Something will turn up there","who":"mama","translation":"到那裡總會找到什麼的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"22 August","translation":"8月22日","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"If you keep it, the chapters after this one will have to be played again.","translation":"如果保留，這一章之後的章節就得重新玩一遍。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Drop the replay","translation":"放棄重玩","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Keep","translation":"保留","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Undo","translation":"復原","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Continue the replay","translation":"繼續重玩","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Back to the main run","translation":"回到主線","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Continue","translation":"繼續","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Start","translation":"開始","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay the chapter","translation":"重玩這一章","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay from here","translation":"從這裡重玩","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"The author’s map","translation":"作者地圖","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"continue\nthe game","translation":"繼續\n遊戲","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"start\nthe game","translation":"開始\n遊戲","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Finale","translation":"結局","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"decided late","translation":"決定得太晚","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"in full","translation":"及時決定","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
  {"text":"Replay","translation":"重玩","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"continue\nthe replay","translation":"繼續\n重玩","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"the author’s map","translation":"作者地圖","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/map.js"},
  {"text":"After Him","translation":"跟在後面","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/after.js"},
  {"text":"A boy with a lantern, and steps behind him.","translation":"拿著提燈的男孩，身後有腳步聲。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/after.js"},
  {"text":"The Armful","translation":"一大捧","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/armful.js"},
  {"text":"Seaweed higher than his head.","translation":"比頭還高的海草。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/armful.js"},
  {"text":"Asleep","translation":"睡著","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/asleep.js"},
  {"text":"A creak, and a hand on the lantern.","translation":"一聲嘎吱，一隻手搭在提燈上。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/asleep.js"},
  {"text":"The beam goes round.","translation":"光束在旋轉。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/beam.js"},
  {"text":"As Far as the Dune","translation":"到沙丘為止","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/beside.js"},
  {"text":"Two in the moonlight, one a little ahead.","translation":"月光下的兩個身影，一個走在稍前面。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/beside.js"},
  {"text":"The Boat","translation":"小船","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/boat.js"},
  {"text":"A heavy boat, and two pulling.","translation":"一艘沉重的小船，兩個人在拉。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/boat.js"},
  {"text":"The Burner, and Run","translation":"燈頭，然後快跑","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The Burner","translation":"燈頭","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The burner — and the door banging below.","translation":"燈頭——樓下的門砰砰作響。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The burner, the storm, and the last paraffin.","translation":"燈頭、暴風雨，還有最後的煤油。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"Below, the door has banged.","translation":"樓下的門砰的一聲。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The flame has turned blue.","translation":"火焰變藍了。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/burner.js"},
  {"text":"The Can","translation":"油罐","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/can.js"},
  {"text":"A full can, and a high threshold.","translation":"滿滿一罐，和高高的門檻。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/can.js"},
  {"text":"The Door","translation":"門","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/door.js"},
  {"text":"Pines against the door.","translation":"門邊的松樹。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/door.js"},
  {"text":"Dust","translation":"灰塵","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/dust.js"},
  {"text":"Dust by the floor, and a line under it.","translation":"地板邊的灰塵，底下有一行字。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/dust.js"},
  {"text":"The Door in the Storm","translation":"暴風雨中的門","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/hold.js"},
  {"text":"A door, and the sea behind it.","translation":"一扇門，門外是大海。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/hold.js"},
  {"text":"Holding Him","translation":"拉住他","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/keep.js"},
  {"text":"A paw on a small shoulder.","translation":"小小肩膀上的一隻爪子。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/keep.js"},
  {"text":"The Knot","translation":"結","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/knot.js"},
  {"text":"A net pulled into a knot.","translation":"一張拉成死結的網。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/knot.js"},
  {"text":"The Ladle","translation":"長柄勺","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/ladle.js"},
  {"text":"A thread of smoke out of the moss under the apple tree.","translation":"蘋果樹下的青苔裡冒出一縷煙。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/ladle.js"},
  {"text":"Ow","who":"papa","translation":"哎喲","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/ladle.js"},
  {"text":"The Lantern","translation":"提燈","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/lantern.js"},
  {"text":"One handle, and two paws on it.","translation":"一個提把，兩隻爪子握著。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/lantern.js"},
  {"text":"The boy’s paw pulls at the handle.","translation":"男孩的爪子拉著提把。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/lantern.js"},
  {"text":"The Lead","translation":"測深錘","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/lead.js"},
  {"text":"A rope with a weight, and black water with no bottom.","translation":"一條綁著重錘的繩子，和沒有底的黑水。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/lead.js"},
  {"text":"The Match","translation":"火柴","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/match.js"},
  {"text":"A wick, a match, and a draught from the gallery.","translation":"燈芯、火柴，和從迴廊吹進來的風。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/match.js"},
  {"text":"The Matchbox","translation":"火柴盒","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"A matchbox, and a hand that does not take it.","translation":"一盒火柴，和一隻不去拿它的手。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"The palm lies open under the box.","translation":"手掌攤開，放在火柴盒底下。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"The stone beside him is bare.","translation":"他旁邊的石頭上空空的。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/matches.js"},
  {"text":"The Mooring","translation":"纜繩","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/mooring.js"},
  {"text":"A mooring line, and a quiet sea.","translation":"一條纜繩，和平靜的海。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/mooring.js"},
  {"text":"The boat tugs at the line.","translation":"小船扯著纜繩。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/mooring.js"},
  {"text":"The Palm","translation":"手掌","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/palm.js"},
  {"text":"A painted gate, and plaster under the paw.","translation":"畫出來的小門，爪子底下是灰泥。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/palm.js"},
  {"text":"To the Cape","translation":"到岬角去","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"Bread, and the rocks to the cape.","translation":"麵包，和通往岬角的岩石。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"A pie, and the rocks to the cape.","translation":"一個派，和通往岬角的岩石。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"You’ll drop it","who":"my","translation":"你會把它摔掉的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/pie.js"},
  {"text":"Over the Rocks","translation":"越過岩石","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/rocks.js"},
  {"text":"Rocks, foam, and a lantern in the wind.","translation":"岩石、浪花，和風中的提燈。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/rocks.js"},
  {"text":"The Shoulder","translation":"肩膀","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/shoulder.js"},
  {"text":"The shoulder stirs under the paw.","translation":"肩膀在爪子底下動了動。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/shoulder.js"},
  {"text":"The Stair","translation":"樓梯","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/stair.js"},
  {"text":"The middle of the stair.","translation":"樓梯的中段。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/stair.js"},
  {"text":"Half a Light","translation":"半明半暗","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"Steady","translation":"穩穩的","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"A low flame, and grey grooves.","translation":"微弱的火光，和灰色的刻痕。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"Soot on the wall, and pencil under it.","translation":"牆上的煙垢，底下有鉛筆字。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/steady.js"},
  {"text":"The Thread","translation":"線","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/thread.js"},
  {"text":"A needle, a thread, and big paws.","translation":"一根針、一條線，和一雙大爪子。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/thread.js"},
  {"text":"The Tiller","translation":"舵柄","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/tiller.js"},
  {"text":"A star over the bow, and three waves coming.","translation":"船頭上方一顆星星，三道浪正湧過來。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/tiller.js"},
  {"text":"Just as planned","who":"papa","translation":"正如計畫","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/minigames/tiller.js"},
  {"text":"narrator","translation":"旁白","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/people.json.narrator short"},
  {"text":"Papa","translation":"爸爸","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/people.json.papa short"},
  {"text":"Mama","translation":"媽媽","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/people.json.mama short"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll","translation":"姆米托魯","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/people.json.troll short"},
  {"text":"My","translation":"小不點","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/people.json.my short"},
  {"text":"Fisherman","translation":"漁夫","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/people.json.fisher short"},
  {"text":"Mama’s garden","translation":"媽媽的花園","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama in her garden","translation":"媽媽在她的花園裡","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama with us","translation":"媽媽和我們在一起","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama’s garden — how much she has painted. It grows when she has time alone, it shrinks when Papa is beside her.","translation":"媽媽的花園——她畫了多少。她有時間獨處時，花園就長大；爸爸在她身邊時，花園就縮小。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The lamp","translation":"燈","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa at the lamp","translation":"爸爸守著燈","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa with his own","translation":"爸爸陪著家人","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The lamp — the sheets by the burner: each one an evening given to the lamp, not to his own.","translation":"燈——燈頭旁的紙頁：每一張都是一個給了燈、而不是給家人的晚上。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Paraffin","translation":"煤油","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"A measure of paraffin burnt","translation":"燒掉了一份煤油","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Paraffin — three measures in the can, one full lantern a night. No sailing for more while the crests are white.","translation":"煤油——罐裡有三份，一晚要裝滿一盞提燈。海上還有白浪時，沒辦法開船去多拿。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Groke’s nights","translation":"莫蘭的夜晚","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"A night of light for the Groke","translation":"給了莫蘭光亮的一夜","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Groke’s nights — nights she was given light. The more, the nearer she sits.","translation":"莫蘭的夜晚——她得到光亮的夜晚。越多，她就坐得越近。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: you decided for everyone.","translation":"媽媽會記得：你替大家做了決定。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: you asked her.","translation":"媽媽會記得：你問過她。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll will remember: his father gave him the lantern.","translation":"姆米托魯會記得：爸爸把提燈給了他。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman will remember: the new keepers.","translation":"漁夫會記得：新來的燈塔看守人。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman will remember: he was called.","translation":"漁夫會記得：有人邀請過他。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman will remember: someone sat beside him.","translation":"漁夫會記得：有人在他身邊坐過。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa promised: “Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp.”","translation":"爸爸答應過：「在我把它點亮之前，我就睡在燈旁邊。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa promised: “Not lit by the full moon — we turn for home.”","translation":"爸爸答應過：「月圓之前還不亮——我們就掉頭回家。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa promised: “I won’t ask.”","translation":"爸爸答應過：「我不會問。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Papa knows the line of 27 August.","translation":"爸爸知道8月27日的那一行字。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: he turned away.","translation":"媽媽會記得：他轉身走開了。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: he called her.","translation":"媽媽會記得：他呼喚過她。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Mama will remember: he waited.","translation":"媽媽會記得：他等過她。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll will remember: “Later.”","translation":"姆米托魯會記得：「等一下再說。」","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll has shut himself away.","translation":"姆米托魯把自己封閉起來了。","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/story.js"}
]}
